; The files 0.3.4's installer put in its folder, for spaceknife.nsh SkRemove034Files: every file
; of app-64.7z in the real SpaceKnife-0.3.4-Setup-x64.exe of the v0.3.4 release (SHA-256
; 383f640a26e81948496594abf3ddbc7a0242bd5e2e7a2b155832b6c33d8acb40; 204 files, read with 7-Zip,
; never run) and the uninstaller it wrote next to them, then every folder they are in, the deepest
; first. Where 0.3.4's own uninstaller can't be used, exactly these names are deleted and these
; folders removed when empty: nothing else in that folder is SpaceKnife's to delete. 0.3.4 is
; released: the list never changes.

